# Large data instances — should not live in git; use git-lfs or release assets.
# The 484 MB of data/ remains tracked for now; new contributors should not add to it.
data/instances/**/*.dat
data/instances/**/*.dat_*
data/instances/**/*.txt
!data/instances/.gitkeep
!data/README.md
